    "The demo dataset, lifted out of store.py so that standing this demo up",
    "for a different company is a data edit rather than a code edit.",
    "Select a profile with BOOKLY_PROFILE=<name> (resolved to",
    "profiles/<name>.json) or BOOKLY_PROFILE=/path/to/other.json.",
    "",
    "What is NOT in here, on purpose: thresholds and reason codes. Those are",
    "policy, they live in policy.py, and a profile must not be able to move",
    "them. Neither is the provenance palette — purple means deterministic and",
    "grey means the model, and that mapping is the design system, not a brand",
    "choice a re-skin gets to break. brand.accent re-skins the wordmark only."
